  "body": "Here is a rare opportunity to secure an affordable home on approximately 408m² (more or less) of flat freehold land in the heart of Takapuna, combining a superb central location with a sunny, easy-care full section and excellent school zones.\r\n\r\nThis well-positioned home offers 3 spacious double bedrooms and 1 bathroom, together with generous living spaces filled with natural light and sunshine. The open-plan living area flows effortlessly out to a sunny deck, creating excellent indoor-outdoor living and an inviting space for entertaining, relaxing or enjoying time with family and friends.\r\n\r\nThe location is the real standout. Takapuna, Milford, Smales Farm, motorway connections, public transport and Auckland CBD are all within easy reach, while Takapuna Beach, Shore City, cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities are only minutes away.\r\n\r\nFamilies will also appreciate the highly desirable school zoning, including Takapuna School, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Takapuna Grammar School, Westlake Boys High School and Westlake Girls High School.\r\n\r\nWith a flat full section, freehold title, spacious interiors, sunny outdoor living and an outstanding Takapuna address, this is a fantastic opportunity to secure location, land and lifestyle at an affordable level.\r\n\r\nCall me today to secure this rare opportunity in the heart of Takapuna.",
